1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,500
In Pakistan, millions of people get bills and medicine boxes they can't easily read.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:14,000
To get help, they show the paper to someone else. That means sharing their name, address and CNIC.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Parho reads the paper on your own device. It hides your private details.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Then it explains the paper in simple Urdu.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The reader is Gemini Nano, running inside Chrome, through Firebase AI Logic's on-device mode.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Watch. I turn the Wi-Fi off.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Now I choose a real electricity bill, with private parts covered. Parho still reads it.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:03,000
The amount, the due date, the units. All on this laptop, in about fifteen seconds.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:13,000
With no internet, nothing can be sent. The cloud button simply waits.

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Back online, with a sample notice. Before anything leaves, you see exactly what the cloud will get.

11
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Text only, no photo. Names and CNIC numbers are replaced.

12
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:43,000
And a safety check in code blocks the request if a CNIC or phone number slips through.

13
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Gemini Nano can't write Urdu yet. So only this step uses Gemini in the cloud.

14
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The answer is short and simple. And it can be read aloud.

15
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:21,000
Parho shows how it handled every step. Which model ran, where, how long it took, and how many bytes left the device.

16
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:33,000
No Gemini Nano? Parho reads with on-device OCR instead. Then it asks before sending any redacted text.

17
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:40,000
We tested Parho on six real FESCO bills and two medicine boxes.

18
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
It got 86 to 95% of key facts right, with zero private details leaked.

19
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:49,500
The cloud gets under 1 KB of text, instead of a 600 KB photo.

20
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:53,000
Parho is open source. Read any paper, privately.
